7. NationalInternetDetector
7.1 States. Required: NORMAL_INTERNATIONAL, RESTRICTED_INTERNATIONAL, DOMESTIC_ONLY_SUSPECTED, PARTIAL_INTERNATIONAL, NETWORK_UNSTABLE, NO_NETWORK, UNKNOWN. Optional additions: CAPTIVE_PORTAL_SUSPECTED, APP_BLOCKED_BY_OS.
